    <!-- Labels the iOS widgets draw and Android has no place for: the Lock
         Screen accessories, the seasonal eyebrows on them, and the titles
         the system shows for the interactive intents. They live here because
         the two platforms share one native widget vocabulary — ios/*.lproj
         is generated from this file — and a phrase translated twice is a
         phrase that drifts. -->
